{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Brave New World of the Internet"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "An Accidental Click"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le10ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Discussing How to Deal with Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "One way to discuss how to deal with problems is to say what you would do if you were in someone else's situation. It is particularly useful if you want to discuss a complicated technical problem."}, {"type": "text", "content": "If you write an article about solving issues, you can use modals like <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to suggest solutions and offer assistance. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I would ...</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">I wouldn't ... </span><br/><span class=\"italic\">You could ... <br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "These are examples of Sally giving suggestions about how to deal with technical problems. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The first thing you should check is the reliability and accuracy of the source you're using."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The second thing you should check is the purpose of the information presented and the author's credentials. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "For example, you could look at the author's background."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wouldn't trust an online source if recognized experts in the field have not reviewed the articles for accuracy."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Questions within Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span><br/>Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you remember how life was before the Internet? (question with sentence)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " However, does that mean you always find what you're looking for online? (asking for clarification)"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "digital native"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who has used the Internet from an early age"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's impossible to remember life before the Internet if you are a digital native."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about the importance of looking for the right information online."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to process"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to go through and absorb a large amount of data"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How do you process all the information you find online?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "at your fingertips"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "readily available"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How do you process all the information that lies at your fingertips?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reliability"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the quality of something you can rely on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should check the reliability of the information."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "accuracy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the quality of something being accurate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should also check the accuracy of the website."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "source"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "place from which you can obtain something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"typ